  "section": "3.248",
  "rulesText": "You gain the following Cunning Strike option.\n\nStealth Attack (Cost: 1d6). If you have the Hide action's Invisible condition, this attack doesn't end that condition on you if you end the turn behind Three-Quarters Cover or Total Cover."
